,79,22],[28225,68.7,2013,57,80,24]],"links":[["Coos County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/oregon/coos-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids shows July to August came in under 90% of normal in 44 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, June to July came in at 33% of normal and May to June at 41% on the middle. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 40% of normal on the middle. Grid 27025 had its driest year in 2013 at 51%.</p>"}
